**additional view = the view that is displayed under the cc when it is in its smaller size

priorities:
1 - least priority
10 - most priority


Bugs:
- non-notched devices have issue with auto-pinch, not apparent on ios 13 for me.

- screen recording breaks when syncing them up for some users, but i made an option to choose whether you use it or not (4)

- fix animations in cc //animations aren't awful, but they're not ideal atm (1)

Features list:
- Choose between showing the Control Center, Notification Center, or a Dynamic combination of both in your App Switcher, which can be accessed by just pinching the switcher.
- When selecting the Notification Center option, it sorts your notifications by app and only shows notifications in the switcher for the app that is being focused on.
- Option to automatically pinch the switcher when you open it.
- Option to make the Control Center in the switcher have different modules than the main control center.
- Option to show "No Older Notifications" text in the Notification Center
- An option to disable animations for inserting/deleting notifications in the switcher.
- An option to show all app notifications in the switcher instead of showing notifications only for the app focused on.
- An option to automatically scroll the Dynamic view based on whether you have notifications or not.

